        "Background in building interactive visualization websites",
        "Expertise in bridging raw data and actionable business insight",
        "Rigorous methodology grounded in statistical best practices",
      ],
    },
    dataeng: {
      title: "Data Engineering & Business Intelligence",
      desc: "Good analysis starts with clean, reliable data. We build the pipelines, warehouses, and dashboards that move your data from raw and scattered to structured, trustworthy, and ready to act on.",
      offers: [
        "ETL and ELT pipelines that ingest, clean, and transform data on a schedule",
        "Data warehouse design and modeling for analytics at scale",
        "Interactive Tableau and BI dashboards built around the decisions you actually make",
        "Automated data-quality checks and validation, so errors surface before they reach a report",
        "SQL, Python, and R workflows documented and built to hand off",
      ],
      why: [
        "Years of hands-on experience in data warehousing and large-scale data management",
        "Production BI and reporting practice: Tableau dashboards, ETL workflows, and validation pipelines",
        "Reproducible, well-documented builds you can maintain after we leave",
        "The same engineering rigor we bring to our published research tooling",
      ],
    },
    tools: {
      title: "Custom Tool Development",
      desc: "We design and build Python libraries, analytical frameworks, and automated pipelines specifically for your workflows. Our tools are open-source ready, well-documented, and built to production standards.",
      offers: [
        "Custom Python packages, documented and tested to production standards",
        "Model diagnostics: residual analysis and fit checks that surface where a model breaks",
        "Explainability built in, so you can see why a model made a call, not just what it predicted",
        "Automated evaluation pipelines with statistical rigor",
        "Experiment tracking and model versioning so results are reproducible",
      ],
      why: [
        "Built model_metrics: a full-featured model evaluation library",
